codex
The engine already comments that `IDLE` is “ready,” but other server paths use `IDLE` as a terminal stop state. That split is the root of the H failure, so the fix should be a small helper that treats post-plan `IDLE` as a terminal follow-up context while preserving pristine `IDLE` startup.
