    29	class ScriptedAgent:
    30	    """Returns pre-scripted AgentSteps. A step item may be an AgentStep, an
    31	    Exception (raised — e.g. LLMContextWindowExceeded), or a callable(view) ->
    32	    AgentStep. `before[i]` runs an async side effect at the start of step i (used
    33	    to simulate a concurrent message arrival)."""
