I’m making the fix in the shared replan predicate instead of marking all `IDLE` as halted. That preserves pristine `IDLE` and normal mid-run behavior, but makes terminal/idle follow-ups with a prior approved plan re-enter planning even after pickup activity has masked the usual “unprocessed” signal.
